{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wendi-e-o036a","title":"魏复郢州为荆州曹丕南征孙权","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-o036a-account","label":"《文帝纪》正文","text":"魏复郢州为荆州曹丕南征孙权","evidence":["wendi-e-o036a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"南征","evidence":["wendi-e-o036a-q"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"拒守","evidence":["wendi-e-o036a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":222,"label":"黄初三年十月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y222","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o028","basis":"黄初三年十月"},"evidence":["wendi-e-o036a-q","wendi-q-o028","wendi-q-b-ffbd612d6e6a445d21d8"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-o036a-q","source_order":[2,337,"O036a"],"order":616}],"persons":[{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0170","name":"曹丕","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wendi-e-o036a-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-a8c7dd464c382d73c13b","layer":"original","quote":"是月，孙权复叛。复郢州为荆州。帝自许昌南征，诸军兵并进。权临江拒守。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":336,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":34},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ffbd612d6e6a445d21d8","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ffbd612d6e6a445d21d8","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：黄初三年（公元 222 ）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":287,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-2c01bc8dd8508fc686e1","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"wendi-q-o028","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-9204f4c854f659a541df","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月〖1〗，丙寅朔，日有食之。庚午〖2〗，行幸许昌宫。诏曰：“今之计、（考）〔孝〕〖3〗，古之贡士也。十室之邑，必有忠信。若限年然后取士〖4〗，是吕尚、周晋不显于前世也〖5〗。其令郡国所选，勿拘老幼；儒通经术，吏达文法〖6〗，到，皆试用。有司纠故不以实者〖7〗。”﹝一﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":281,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":138}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
